Based on the error pattern analysis above, identify the ROOT CAUSE of the numerical error.
Then provide the COMPLETE FIXED C++ code.

Focus on:
1. Assembly index convention (K[i,j] = B[i]^T*D*B[j] vs B[j]^T*D*B[i])
